                                   ListPattern, OrPattern, Callees, InFull, Among, Constant,
                                   Unwritten, Variable, Binary, Unary, Lambda, Call, OnValue,
                                   OnValueCall, If, Match, Record, RecordUpdate, Field, ListOf,
                                   Perform, Handle, WithHold, Simulate, Parallel, Tagged, Filled,
                                   FilledHole, TryBlock, RaisedOperation, Block, Arm, StoredHandle,
                                   Clause, Entry, One, Commuting, Let, LetElse, Effectful, Assign,
                                   Generics, ParameterConstraint, Returning, Unstated, Fresh,
                                   ParameterReturned, FunctionForm, Variant, TypeBody, Alias, Sum,
                                   Nominal, Extern, InstanceFunction, Numeric, TypeForm, Operation,
                                   EffectForm, TestForm, LawForm, SpecForm, Form, FunctionOf,
